{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Tarbut.</b> From the stem of אשר טפחתי ורביתי, and it is close to the stem of על כל רב ביתו. The meaning is: great in years." "<b>Le-sapot.</b> Like le-hosif, only it is from a different root, and like it is ספו על זבחיכם. For we do not find among words with yod [as third radical] this root in the binyan qal with missing yod."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:06.495573624Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}